---
import InnerLayout from "../../layouts/InnerLayout.astro";
import LinkBox from "../../components/ITserviceLinkBox.astro";
---

<InnerLayout>
  <section class="it-services-all">
    <div class="container">
      <LinkBox />
      <div class="text-container">
        <h3>IT INFRA MANAGEMENT</h3>
        <p>
          Our Remote Infrastructure Management Service helps you manage your IT
          Infrastructure effectively with 24/7 proactive monitoring, real-time
          reporting of device health statistics and usage information via a
          secure, dedicated VPN tunnel. With our managed services, you’ll be
          able to:
        </p>
        <p>
          Improve network availability and reduce downtime – we monitor and
          manage LAN, WAN, Server and VOIP Infrastructure, Security and VPN.
        </p>
        <p>
          Lower the total cost of ownership – our experts complement the core
          competencies of your IT staff, taking up network management and
          freeing up internal IT resources to focus on strategic business
          issues.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/contact">CONTACT US</a>TODAY TO DISCUSS IT INFRA MANAGEMENT?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="img-container">
        <img src="/images/icons/technology.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InnerLayout>
